[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429461534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2429461534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2429461534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6QzqQe","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T14:34:00Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T14:36:12Z","body":"I've tried to use the following code, but despite `create_tmp()` being static, I get an error:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar tmp_file := FileAccess.create_tmp(FileAccess.WRITE_READ, \".txt\")\r\n\ttmp_file.store_string(\"I am *not* persisted after the file is closed.\")\r\n\ttmp_file.close()\r\n\tOS.shell_open(tmp_file.get_path_absolute())  # Should fail because the file has been removed at this point.\r\n\r\n\tvar tmp_file_keep := FileAccess.create_tmp(FileAccess.WRITE_READ, \".txt\", true)\r\n\ttmp_file_keep.store_string(\"I am persisted after the file is closed.\")\r\n\ttmp_file.close()\r\n\tOS.shell_open(tmp_file_keep.get_path_absolute())  # Should work because `keep` is `true`.\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nCannot call method 'store_string' on a null value.\r\n```\r\n\r\nPS: Do modes other than `FileAccess.WRITE` make sense here? The file path is guaranteed to not exist before creation, so I don't think other FileAccess modes make sense to use here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429461534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429593910","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2429593910","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2429593910,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q0Kk2","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T15:26:24Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T15:26:24Z","body":"@Calinou The cleanup is done on the `FileAccess` destructor. So, `.close()` doesn't clean-up the file per se.\r\n\r\nI did this because `FileAccess::reopen()` exists, but I just saw that it is not exposed to the public API (`_bind_methods()`).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429593910/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429595585","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2429595585","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2429595585,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q0K_B","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T15:27:05Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T16:52:07Z","body":"> This crashes on startup on Windows 11 23H2 (before the crash handler is initialized, so I used the VS debugger to get a backtrace):\r\n> \r\n> ```\r\n>  \tntdll.dll!00007ffc43636fa1()\tUnknown\r\n>  \tntdll.dll!00007ffc435ac115()\tUnknown\r\n>  \tntdll.dll!00007ffc435a936c()\tUnknown\r\n>  \tntdll.dll!00007ffc43613e83()\tUnknown\r\n>  \tKernelBase.dll!00007ffc40d18c91()\tUnknown\r\n> >\tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!OS_Windows::get_tmp_path() Line 1868\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!EditorPaths::EditorPaths() Line 182\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!EditorPaths::create() Line 106\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!Main::setup2(bool p_show_boot_logo) Line 2736\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!Main::setup(const char * execpath, int argc, char * * argv, bool p_second_phase) Line 2632\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!widechar_main(int argc, wchar_t * * argv) Line 165\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!_main() Line 206\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!main(int argc, char * * argv) Line 220\tC++\r\n>  \tgodot.windows.editor.x86_64.exe!WinMain(HINSTANCE__ * hInstance, HINSTANCE__ * hPrevInstance, char * lpCmdLine, int nCmdShow) Line 234\tC++\r\n>  \t[External Code]\t\r\n> ```\r\n\r\nShould be fixed!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429595585/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429714141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2429714141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2429714141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q0n7d","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T16:17:08Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T16:17:08Z","body":"> PS: Do modes other than `FileAccess.WRITE` make sense here? The file path is guaranteed to not exist before creation, so I don't think other FileAccess modes make sense to use here.\r\n\r\nWhat I did is that I create the file first with WRITE, then close, then open it again with the mode wished.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2429714141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430065950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2430065950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2430065950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q190e","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-22T19:20:43Z","updated_at":"2024-10-22T19:20:43Z","body":"https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/android?msg=3peujMoKbDJCQ0eul\r\n\r\n> Todo: Android bindings for OS::get_tmp_dir()\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/Alex2782/godot/tree/get_tmp_dir_for_android\r\n\r\n5 files changed, +41 lines: https://github.com/Alex2782/godot/commit/9dd4af4d35dac9913e339cebcb67a0e5e325cedf\r\n\r\n\r\n``` gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tprint(\"get_cache_dir(): \", OS.get_cache_dir())\r\n\tprint(\"get_tmp_dir(): \", OS.get_tmp_dir())\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89272075-de9f-4591-92c1-25584ee45514)\r\n\r\n\r\nTested on Android 13, Samsung Tab S7. I'm still not sure if I've taken everything into account correctly.\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2430065950/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432630398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2432630398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2432630398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Q_v5-","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-23T15:29:35Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T15:29:35Z","body":"I added `GetLongPathNameW()` to decode the short path into the long standard one.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432630398/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432839474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2432839474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2432839474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RAi8y","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-23T16:48:22Z","updated_at":"2024-10-23T16:48:22Z","body":"I added the `prefix` param to `FileAccess::create_tmp()`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2432839474/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2437839028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2437839028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2437839028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6RTni0","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-10-25T13:51:34Z","updated_at":"2024-10-25T14:21:22Z","body":"I reworked my PR on many fronts:\r\n- the random `hash` suffix is now a datetime suffix with the usec ticks appended to it (to make sure that two tmp files created the same second don't clash).\r\n- the prefix and extension have an added check to make sure they are valid file names (i.e. not accept slashes and such).\r\n- `DirAccess` now writes on the last open error if `create_tmp` don't work.\r\n- made `{File,Dir}Access::_create_tmp()` private.\r\n- `{File,Dir}Access::create_tmp()` now print meaningful errors.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2437839028/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468667145","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2468667145","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2468667145,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TJN8J","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T17:14:08Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T17:14:15Z","body":"We try to avoid abbreviations in the API, so we should probably avoid `tmp` throughout, even if that's the canonical Unix name. On Windows it would be `temp` which is at least bit better to the uninitiated.\r\n\r\nWe could go all the way with `temporary`, but since we do use `dir` already as an abbreviation in some of these APIs, I think something like `OS::get_temp_dir` / `DirAccess::create_temp_dir` / `FileAccess::create_temp_file` (note I'm adding `_dir` and `_file` for the DA/FA APIs, which I think are clearer than just `create_tmp`).\r\n\r\nThoughts?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468667145/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468837693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2468837693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2468837693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TJ3k9","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-11T18:57:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-11T18:57:24Z","body":"`temp` is a common shorthand in programming to name _anything_ temporary. Namely variables, but also game assets, in a similar vein to `dummy`.\r\nSo I think it's reasonably appropriate, but it's also worth noting there's no existing method in the API with \"_temp_\" or \"_temporary_\" in their name. The closest thing is the `{temp_dir}` placeholder for SSH Remote Deploy scripts.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2468837693/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471220318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2471220318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2471220318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TS9Re","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T18:01:00Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T18:01:15Z","body":"`temp` is only slightly more verbose than `tmp`, and conveys the exact same information that `temporary` would. And while `temp` isn't used by any of *our* API, it IS used by the Python standard library `tempfile` which we import in some of our buildscripts (and all of its functions/variables). My vote is for `temp`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2471220318/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2483729797","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2483729797","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2483729797,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UCrWF","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-18T17:50:59Z","updated_at":"2024-11-18T17:50:59Z","body":"I added a commit that renames `tmp` to `temp`! Thanks for the input everyone.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2483729797/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2486595308","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98397#issuecomment-2486595308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98397","id":2486595308,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6UNm7s","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-19T19:39:57Z","updated_at":"2024-11-19T19:39:57Z","body":"I would sti